### Test requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP Client)
### Start the service first: uvicorn app.main:app --reload
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health: model, embedding model, threshold, guard
GET {{base}}/health

### 1. First question: miss, the LLM answers and the answer is cached
POST {{base}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "How do I reset my password?"}

### 2. Same meaning, different words: semantic hit, no LLM call
POST {{base}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "I forgot my password"}

### 3. Same question, different casing and punctuation: exact hit
POST {{base}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "how do i reset my password"}

### 4. Known weakness: "change" vs "reset" password scores 0.87 and IS served from the cache
###    (see "Limitations" in the README). Use bypass_cache or a stricter threshold for such cases.
POST {{base}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "How do I change my password?"}

### 4b. Same words, different meaning, and caught: a different intent with low similarity
POST {{base}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "How do I delete my account?"}

### 5. Invoice for order 1001
POST {{base}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "Can I get the invoice for order 1001?"}

### 6. Order 1002: very similar text, blocked by the entity guard (see guard_rejected_question)
POST {{base}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "Can I get the invoice for order 1002?"}

### 7. Another tenant never sees the first tenant's answers
POST {{base}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "I forgot my password", "namespace": "other-shop"}

### 8. Skip the cache (time-sensitive question)
POST {{base}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "How do I reset my password?", "bypass_cache": true}

### 9. Why did (or didn't) a question hit? Nearest cached questions, no LLM call
POST {{base}}/cache/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "I lost my password"}

### 10. Hit rate, cost saved, latency of hits vs misses
GET {{base}}/stats

### 11. Cached entries, most used first
GET {{base}}/cache/entries

### 12. Empty the cache of one namespace (omit the parameter to empty everything)
DELETE {{base}}/cache?namespace=other-shop
